        "chapter_1": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Client expectations",
            "text": "<p>Supramood needed a cohesive digital presence that reflected its lifestyle and wellness positioning while making it easier for customers to discover, connect with, and shop the brand.</p><p>The scope brought together brand strategy, a redesign of their existing e-commerce website, SEO optimization, and original photo and video content. They also wanted to extend their brand story through a dedicated podcast, automated email marketing, and opportunities for user-generated content and affiliate partnerships.</p>"
          }
        },
        "chapter_2": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How we did it",
            "text": "<p>We began by refining Supramood’s brand foundations, aligning its positioning, messaging, and visual direction. That strategy guided the website redesign and content creation, bringing consistency to how the brand looked, sounded, and connected with its audience.</p><p>Working within their existing website platform, we refreshed the design, improved the user experience, and optimized the site’s SEO. We also integrated additional payment options to give customers more flexibility at checkout.</p><p>To bring the brand story to life, we produced original photography and video assets and introduced a dedicated podcast series. Email automations connected the shopping experience with relevant follow-up communications, while affiliate program development supported the brand’s broader goals for community participation and UGC partnerships.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
